1. Project Title
FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models
2. System Architecture
FitBuddy consists of the following main components:
User Interface – Collects user fitness details.
Application Logic – Processes the user's information.
Google Gemini AI – Generates a personalized fitness plan.
Output Module – Displays the generated plan to the user.
Flow:
User → FitBuddy Interface → Application Logic → Gemini AI → Fitness Plan → User
3. Input Design
The application collects:
Name
Age
Height
Weight
Fitness goal
Activity level
Fitness experience
Available workout time
4. Processing
User enters fitness information.
User selects a fitness goal.
FitBuddy prepares an AI prompt.
The prompt is sent to the Gemini model.
Gemini generates a personalized fitness plan.
The generated plan is displayed to the user.
5. Output Design
The system generates:
Personalized workout plan
Exercise recommendations
Weekly workout schedule
General nutrition suggestions
Fitness tips
